# unit_physics_04b: more unit tests (fx) from the start of a Novice race
# for paths of the bank 04 physics tree unit_physics_04 leaves:
# - FxObjectBounce on six more records with touch lists ($1642, $1694,
#   $16E6, $17D0, $19B0, $1A54), for a hit from below;
# - FxPartsUpdate on the car $1738 with its wheel $16E6 a pulled part:
#   with the car's +$64 bit 0 set and the part's bit 2 clear; and with
#   the part far below, far above and close to the record $1918's
#   first part, its speeds of the other sign;
# - FxCarFollowCourse on $1738 with its +$2C bit 6 set, placed far off
#   the course (no nearest entry), and marked fallen (+$1C bit 4) with
#   no course entry (+$58 = 0: FxCarAimAlongCourse does nothing; it
#   returns two levels up, through the word under the stack, staged
#   at $0242 as the STOP);
# - FxCarCollide on $1738 with its +$16 bit 4 clear and a touch list
#   ($1576), and also with its +$64 bit 4 set.
# - FxCollideModel of $1738 against the record $21DE turned by $2000
#   (not a quarter turn: FxTurn), by $4000, $8000 and $C000, with no
#   collision list (+$14 = 0) and with a list whose +$0C word is 0.
load build/stuntracefx/states/novice_coupe_race1.state
fx 04:907A stop=888C r8=1642 r10=0244
wait 1
load build/stuntracefx/states/novice_coupe_race1.state
fx 04:907A stop=888C r8=1694 r10=0244
wait 1
